	<description xmlns="http://purl.org/dc/terms/">Global anthropogenic CO2 emissions based on EDGARv4.3, fuel type and category specific emissions provided by Greet Janssens-Maenhout (EU-JRC), BP statistics 2016 (http://www.bp.com/content/dam/bp/excel/energy-economics/statistical-review-2016/bp-statistical-review-of-world-energy-2016-workbook.xlsx), temporal variations based on MACC-TNO (https://gmes-atmosphere.eu/documents/deliverables/d-emis/MACC_TNO_del_1_3_v2.pdf), temporal extrapolation and disaggregation described in COFFEE (Steinbach et al. 2011).</description>
	<title xmlns="http://purl.org/dc/terms/">Global anthropogenic CO2 emissions based on EDGARv4.3 and BP statistics 2016</title>
	<hasTemporalResolution xmlns="http://meta.icos-cp.eu/ontologies/cpmeta/">hourly</hasTemporalResolution>
