	<description xmlns="http://purl.org/dc/terms/">This is a version of the GFAS fire emissions (https://doi.org/10.5194/acp-18-5359-2018), re-gridded to match the resolution of the biosphere, fossil fuel, and ocean fluxes of the CTE-HR product. Please always cite the original GFAS data when using this file, and use the original data when only fire emissions are required. For more information, see  https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.6477331
 Contains modified Copernicus Atmosphere Monitoring Service Information [2020].</description>
